  "note": "A single Kenyon-cell spike already carries APL most of the way to threshold, and a single APL spike removes more than a full threshold gap from every Kenyon cell it touches, while APL's output rate is capped by the refractory period. A graded controller has become a saturated switch, and it is the only feedback that keeps the odour code sparse."
